'''Hijiri Rokudo''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 6.8 gains [[Area Attack]] and increases health, range, and attack animation length, but loses some attack power and the [[Multi-Hit]] ability.

