==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hijiri Rokudo CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Baseball Mask γ''' using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hijiri is one of the most useful cats available from the Power Pro Collab. She is basically a dedicated [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or a stronger but less spammable [[Sarukani (Uber Rare Cat)|Sarukani]], and fulfills a role that has few units fulfilling it. As she has Zombie Killer, she can use her high damage to take out smaller zombies in one hit, with no risk of other units taking the kill and causing them to revive. Her also formidable DPS means that building up multiple of her can pose a decent threat to larger zombies over time, and while her range and single-target attack can cause issues with that goal, that issue is fixed in her [[True Form]].

==='''True Form'''===
Baseball Mask γ is a direct upgrade to Hijiri that grants her the two things she was really missing: Area Attack and a range boost. There is a noticeable attack damage decrease (around 25%), but Area Attack and the range increase are so beneficial that this is a small price to pay. Packing attack power that is over double Paris's, Baseball Mask γ still has a serious punch and excels at putting Zombies to rest. Do note that her range is roughly mid-range, at 300 it is still 50 less than [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] or Cyborg. This still puts her outside the range of many zombies, but some will manage to reach her. For those zombies that do reach her, her remarkably high health, especially against zombies, allows her to tank some hits, sometimes even without taking knockbacks, making her great against [[Zamelle]], [[Inumusha]] or [[Daboo of the Dead|Daboo]]; if you are lucky enough to have her, you will likely never have problems with Zamelle anymore, as she can easily kill it permanently, no matter the support. This is helpful in levels like [[Lovechild Lane]] or [[50 Degrees Hotter]]. Overall, once in her True Form she is an incredibly useful Anti-Zombie cat, and should be a strong consideration for any zombie stage you are attempting. Getting her True Form is also extremely cheap, requiring only 3 purple catfruit, and thus should be a high priority if you have any need for an [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] unit.

